{"recordId":"emperor_李元昊","name":"李元昊","type":"emperor","dynasty":"遼夏金","title":"西夏開祖","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"李元昊","pageId":148645,"revisionId":94590378,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-09-26T14:55:55Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%9D%8E%E5%85%83%E6%98%8A","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94590378","wikidataId":"Q7438","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"辭海（1999年版縮印本）","url":null,"type":"citation-template","template":"cite book","author":"辭海編輯委員會","publisher":"上海辭書出版社","date":"2000","isbn":"7532608395","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"西夏皇帝尊號考略","url":null,"type":"citation-template","template":"cite journal","author":"","publisher":"寧夏大學學報（人文社會科學版）","date":"2007","isbn":"","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"夏漢字典","url":null,"type":"citation-template","template":"cite book","author":"李範文","publisher":"中國社會科學出版社","date":"1997","isbn":"7-5004-2113-3","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"宋史","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"續資治通鑑長編","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"遼史","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:35:04.997Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:liaoshi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:liaoshi-721af38f952492d4","query":"李元昊","count":1,"offset":3572,"excerpt":"國遣使來貢。甲寅，錄囚。夏四月己巳，以興平公主薨，遣北院承旨耶律庶成持詔問夏國王李元昊，公主生與元昊不睦，沒，詰其故。己卯，獵白馬堝。甲申，射兔新澱井。乙未，獵金山，遣楊家進鹿尾茸於大安宮。六月乙亥，禦清涼殿試進士，賜邢彭年以下五十五人第。秋七月","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:liaoshi-d6d5fafd16fcc044","query":"李元昊","count":2,"offset":2410,"excerpt":"五月壬戌朔，羅漢奴奏所發部兵與党項戰不利，招討使蕭普達、四捷軍詳穩張佛奴歿於陣。李元昊來援叛黨。戊辰，詔征諸道兵會西南邊以討元昊。六月甲午，阻卜酋長烏八遣其子執元昊所遣求援使窊邑改來，乞以兵助戰，從之。駐蹕永安山。以將伐夏，遣延昌宮使耶律高家奴告","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:liaoshi-6e8450fc2e65485d","query":"李元昊","count":3,"offset":500,"excerpt":"嘲穩部。是月，詔士庶言國家利便，不得及己事，奴婢所見，許白其主，不得自陳。夏國王李元昊薨，其子諒祚遣使來告，即遣永興宮使耶律裏、右護衛太保耶律興老、將作少監王全慰奠。三月癸卯，以同知南京留守事蕭塔烈葛為左夷離畢，知右夷離畢事唐古為右夷離畢。丙午，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:liaoshi-2c35ad4b3ead8c8a","query":"李元昊","count":1,"offset":1575,"excerpt":"，賊以鋸解之，憤罵至死。\n\n孫 紹芳\n\n紹芳，重熙間參知政事，加兼侍中。時延議征李元昊，力諫不聽，出為廣德軍節度使。聞敗，嘔血卒。\n\n孫 資讓\n\n孫資讓，壽隆初拜中書侍郎、平章事。會宋徽宗嗣位，遣使來報，有司按籍，有「登寶位」文，坐是出為崇義軍節","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:liaoshi-cd71617c396f8f97","query":"李元昊","count":1,"offset":848,"excerpt":"\n\n蕭朮哲，字石魯隱，孝穆弟高九之子。以戚屬加監門衛上將軍。重熙十三年，將衛兵討李元昊有功，遷興聖宮使。蒲奴裏部長陶得裏叛，朮哲為統軍都監，從都統耶律義先擊之，擒陶得裏。朮哲與義先不協，誣義先罪，免官。稍遷西南面招討都監，坐事下獄，以太后言，杖而","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:liaoshi-9083500f8cb0130a","query":"李元昊","count":1,"offset":754,"excerpt":"首事功，進王韓。十二年，兼北府宰相，同知元帥府事，又為北樞密使。\n\n十三年，夏國李元昊誘山南党項諸部，帝親征。元昊懼，請降。惠曰：「元昊忘奕世恩，萌奸計，車駕親臨，不盡歸所掠。天誘其衷，使彼來迎。天與不圖，後悔何及？」帝從之。詰旦，進軍。夏人列拒","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:liaoshi-8bf70ceb1efe8154","query":"李元昊","count":1,"offset":143,"excerpt":"人廢言。」是宜傳。\n\n羅衣輕，不知其鄉里。滑稽通變，一時諧謔，多所規諷。興宗敗於李元昊也，單騎突出，幾不得脫。先是，元昊獲遼人，輒劓其鼻，有奔北者惟恐追及。故羅衣輕止之曰：「且觀鼻在否？」上怒，以毳索系帳後，將殺之。太子笑曰：「打諢底不是黃幡綽！","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:liaoshi-a2a8160a47d0d869","query":"李元昊","count":1,"offset":1061,"excerpt":"三年，西征，以古叠為先鋒。夏人伏兵掩之，古叠力戰，麾下士多歿，乃單騎突出。遇夏王李元昊來圍，勢甚急。古叠馳射，應弦輒仆，躍馬直擊中堅，夏兵不能當，晡乃還營。改興聖宮太保。清寧九年，從重元、涅魯古亂，與扈從兵戰，敗而遁，追擒之，陵遲而死。\n\n撒剌竹","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:liaoshi-b5f3cffa4cf4c693","query":"李元昊","count":3,"offset":2554,"excerpt":"後垂紅結綬。自號嵬名，設官分文武。〔自號嵬名設官分文武　按宋史四八五夏國傳上作：李元昊「自號嵬名吾祖，凡六日、九日，則見官屬，其官分文武班。〕」其冠用金縷貼，間起雲，銀紙帖，緋衣，金塗銀帶，佩蹀躞、解錐、短刀、弓矢，穿靴，禿髮，耳重環，紫旋襴六襲","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":9,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:liaoshi-721af38f952492d4","bookId":"book:liaoshi","requestedTitle":"遼史/卷18","title":"遼史/卷18","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%81%BC%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B718","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2330384","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%81%BC%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B718?action=history","revisionId":2330384,"revisionTimestamp":"2023-11-07T02:32:56Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:56:02.271Z","sha256":"cba88a2f54574db6ec739afcf18e456a4d00ede635b6c6dc9d0d5d1092d0fb02","textSha256":"fdcec18d33f75fa726699be33b2bd53f5e7f26080dfdde71259b8da0c98f67a7","expandedWikitextSha256":"cba88a2f54574db6ec739afcf18e456a4d00ede635b6c6dc9d0d5d1092d0fb02","characters":4533,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/liaoshi.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:40.875Z","upstreamTextQuality":50,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":["Textquality 50% 是維基文庫平台品質標記，不代表正文已轉錄比例。"],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/504d30fa395b2dad4a53.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/504d30fa395b2dad4a53.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:liaoshi-d6d5fafd16fcc044","bookId":"book:liaoshi","requestedTitle":"遼史/卷19","title":"遼史/卷19","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%81%BC%E5